    "EcoCard is documented as available (no Rho‑Bank+ requirement in the docs) and provides the largest documented APY bonus on the Gold Account (+0.60%) even after its $50 fee.",
    "No other savings tier you can open with $20k (Silver, Silver Plus, Bronze) produces a higher net interest−fee than Gold + EcoCard."
