  "assumptions_and_constraints_confirmed": [
    "You keep Light Blue checking (no Light Blue-linked APY boost applies).",
    "You do not have Rho‑Bank+ (so I excluded combos that require it).",
    "You will leave exactly $20,000 untouched in savings for 1 full year.",
    "All numbers use documented base APYs, documented card APY bonuses, and documented card fees from the knowledge base.",
    "I did not include taxes or card cashback from everyday spending in the primary comparison (this calculation is strictly: interest on $20k for 1 year minus the card's annual fee)."
  ],
  "final_recommendation": "Gold Account (savings) paired with EcoCard — net ≈ $1,170 on $20,000 after one year.",
  "next_steps": {
    "options": [
      "I can summarize the exact steps to open the Gold Account and to apply for the EcoCard.",
